# weak_sshd_config - a synthetic sshd_config shaped to demonstrate what
# this linter catches. Every weakness here is a shape, not an attack.

Port 22
Protocol 2,1

PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords yes
HostbasedAuthentication yes
IgnoreRhosts no

MaxAuthTries 10
LoginGraceTime 300
ClientAliveInterval 0
ClientAliveCountMax 10

X11Forwarding yes
UsePAM no

LogLevel ERROR

Ciphers aes128-cbc,3des-cbc,arcfour256
MACs hmac-md5,hmac-sha1-96,umac-64@openssh.com
KexAlgorithms diffie-hellman-group1-sha1,diffie-hellman-group14-sha1
